# Terraform safety

Run plan before apply. Do not commit state files or secrets in tfvars.

Pin provider versions to match existing blocks. Do not rename resources
that would force destructive recreation without approval.

For AWS-specific networking and IAM depth, enable cloud-aws alongside
this plugin when both apply.
